72200.def:
This sub-class includes the activities of research and development in:
•social sciences such as economics and/or business administration; psychology and/or cognitive sciences; education; sociology; law; political sciences; media and/or communication; 
•arts and/or humanities such as history and archeology; literature and/or languages; philosophy; 
•socio-economic relations
•interdisciplinary research predominantly on social sciences, arts and/or humanities.
